{"about_the_game":"Pride Run features 2 amazing game modes:<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanilla</h2></strong><br>The &quot;Vanilla&quot; game mode is instantly recognisable as a fun and colourful, Rhythm Action game, that will have you hitting every beat of the amazing Disco soundtrack by \u2018Hard Ton\u2019. Hitting the beats will have the spectators joining the parade, missing the beats will cause them to leave. Keep the parade going until the end before taking on those that question LGBTQ+ rights in an epic dance battles and conquer hate with love!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Hard</h2></strong><br>The \u201cPlay Hard\u201d game mode adds a unique RTS twist to the game, delivering all the entertaining over the top gameplay from the \u2018Vanilla\u2019 mode but with a unique tactical element. Customise your parade, pick your leaders from the various groups and use their abilities to amplify your message of love and inclusivity or shield the parade from those who want to rain on your parade. Move the groups around in real time to ensure your abilities and leaders are where you need them. <br><br>Both game modes can be played as single player or local co-op, as well as featuring 3 difficulty modes (Virgin, Vicious &amp; Queen). You will find unique events and characters that reflects every city of the parade.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/607adabfc41a010f699ec0d3a6e21bba.poster.avif?t=1598953863\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/607adabfc41a010f699ec0d3a6e21bba.webm?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/607adabfc41a010f699ec0d3a6e21bba.mp4?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pride Run features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rhythm Action based gameplay - encourage the audience to join in with the parade as you hit every beat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on one of two game modes, \u2018Vanilla\u2019 and \u2018Play Hard\u2019, whilst dancing to the beat of the amazing \u2018Hard Ton\u2019.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In Play Hard mode, choose which groups to add to the parades to take on those who question LGBTQ+ rights.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In Vanilla mode you\u2019ll follow the beat along the streets of each city.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Spread the love and pride across 16 cities in the world. After all, the world needs more love!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/6f2f44101054f5f230136983f359a7f6.poster.avif?t=1598953863\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/6f2f44101054f5f230136983f359a7f6.webm?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/6f2f44101054f5f230136983f359a7f6.mp4?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pride Run celebrates all things Pride, LGBTQ+ and inclusiveness. The game has you leading Parades in key cities all around the world, encapsulating the fun, colour, excitement and inclusive nature of all Pride Parades.<br><br>Be loud, be proud and spread the message of love!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/52eab49b8c150e4e42dea2b40d9e988c.avif?t=1598953863\" width=500 height=600 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c643a730400f111cff0a123913cd5e03b51945e3.jpg","localized_name":"San Francisco!","name":"San Francisco!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/c643a730400f111cff0a123913cd5e03b51945e3.jpg"},{"icon":"726e21cc8ce0043198d8deec7c4c3ac4a3748ef7.jpg","localized_name":"Madrid!","name":"Madrid!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/726e21cc8ce0043198d8deec7c4c3ac4a3748ef7.jpg"},{"icon":"5f91a4a53b839c759dd1f749562fba08da1e0ff1.jpg","localized_name":"Toronto!","name":"Toronto!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/5f91a4a53b839c759dd1f749562fba08da1e0ff1.jpg"},{"icon":"b514f0b35af45243b24613e8510bfeea7789a298.jpg","localized_name":"Tokyo!","name":"Tokyo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/b514f0b35af45243b24613e8510bfeea7789a298.jpg"},{"icon":"f13f6adf9708d32ac3d54a1084e835d7753c4d12.jpg","localized_name":"New Delhi!","name":"New Delhi!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/f13f6adf9708d32ac3d54a1084e835d7753c4d12.jpg"},{"icon":"3e7f92b2593aae740bb8564bf4bc101c091ecb2b.jpg","localized_name":"Stockholm!","name":"Stockholm!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/3e7f92b2593aae740bb8564bf4bc101c091ecb2b.jpg"},{"icon":"48466cef7afef49438d06cf40d1f2d3ff9c175c8.jpg","localized_name":"Paris!","name":"Paris!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/48466cef7afef49438d06cf40d1f2d3ff9c175c8.jpg"},{"icon":"0770bfe1ccc6dfa3ef2204d318a4798b40a50e3c.jpg","localized_name":"Sydney!","name":"Sydney!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/0770bfe1ccc6dfa3ef2204d318a4798b40a50e3c.jpg"},{"icon":"f0390ab0a08f76312ff470a24a8d0aa8aa9d18d6.jpg","localized_name":"Berlin!","name":"Berlin!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/f0390ab0a08f76312ff470a24a8d0aa8aa9d18d6.jpg"},{"icon":"eadcf1652249db64f73afc40a7f19d99e6641563.jpg","localized_name":"Istanbul","name":"Istanbul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848330/eadcf1652249db64f73afc40a7f19d99e6641563.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/848330?t=1598953863","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/848330?t=1598953863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1598953863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1598953863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Pride Run is a celebration of Pride events and the LGBTQ community in general. The game is presented in a satirical way which includes the visualisation of adult toys. In addition, there is the occasional use of adult words plus the occasional portrayal of topless females.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned, all adult themes are portrayed in a satirical way and not used in any meaningful context. There are no sexual acts of violence in this game."},"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/c832a37f755a8c9b4cf360913177af22.poster.avif?t=1598953863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/c832a37f755a8c9b4cf360913177af22.webm?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Pride Run features 2 amazing game modes:<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanilla</h2></strong><br>The &quot;Vanilla&quot; game mode is instantly recognisable as a fun and colourful, Rhythm Action game, that will have you hitting every beat of the amazing Disco soundtrack by \u2018Hard Ton\u2019. Hitting the beats will have the spectators joining the parade, missing the beats will cause them to leave. Keep the parade going until the end before taking on those that question LGBTQ+ rights in an epic dance battles and conquer hate with love!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Hard</h2></strong><br>The \u201cPlay Hard\u201d game mode adds a unique RTS twist to the game, delivering all the entertaining over the top gameplay from the \u2018Vanilla\u2019 mode but with a unique tactical element. Customise your parade, pick your leaders from the various groups and use their abilities to amplify your message of love and inclusivity or shield the parade from those who want to rain on your parade. Move the groups around in real time to ensure your abilities and leaders are where you need them. <br><br>Both game modes can be played as single player or local co-op, as well as featuring 3 difficulty modes (Virgin, Vicious &amp; Queen). You will find unique events and characters that reflects every city of the parade.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/607adabfc41a010f699ec0d3a6e21bba.poster.avif?t=1598953863\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/607adabfc41a010f699ec0d3a6e21bba.webm?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/607adabfc41a010f699ec0d3a6e21bba.mp4?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pride Run features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rhythm Action based gameplay - encourage the audience to join in with the parade as you hit every beat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on one of two game modes, \u2018Vanilla\u2019 and \u2018Play Hard\u2019, whilst dancing to the beat of the amazing \u2018Hard Ton\u2019.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In Play Hard mode, choose which groups to add to the parades to take on those who question LGBTQ+ rights.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In Vanilla mode you\u2019ll follow the beat along the streets of each city.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Spread the love and pride across 16 cities in the world. After all, the world needs more love!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/6f2f44101054f5f230136983f359a7f6.poster.avif?t=1598953863\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/6f2f44101054f5f230136983f359a7f6.webm?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/6f2f44101054f5f230136983f359a7f6.mp4?t=1598953863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pride Run celebrates all things Pride, LGBTQ+ and inclusiveness. The game has you leading Parades in key cities all around the world, encapsulating the fun, colour, excitement and inclusive nature of all Pride Parades.<br><br>Be loud, be proud and spread the message of love!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848330/extras/52eab49b8c150e4e42dea2b40d9e988c.avif?t=1598953863\" width=500 height=600 /></span>","developers":["Steam Factory","Hard Ton","IV Producti